              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chefjeff"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This beverage is wonderful. For years, I've tried to learn to \"appreciate\" the herbal bitterness of Campari, to no avail. The adding of sweet vermouth, is the ticket for me. Thanks for sharing.\r\nBy the way, this Vodka drinker has found that it can be substituted for the gin!\r\nCheers,\r\nJeff"
