              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "plates4u"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this just to try it since I have heard of it but never tried one. Honestly, I can say it is not my type of drink, but I do like my drinks stiff. Therefore, if you like a stiff apéritif, this is it! If I need a stiff one, this is one of my options for sure!",
